  "body": "This defines the next SDK repair around the confirmed112-byte GSG member-layout mismatch: retain the installed Panda wheel, build a separate Cg-aware SDK candidate, and independently verify actual member offsets/compile-only layout data. It does not build the candidate or establish the prior SIGABRT cause/fix.\n\nNVIDIA original Cg3.1 headers were acquired and pinned: archive24829131bytes/SHAe8ff01e6cc38d1b3fd56a083f5860737dbd2f319a39037528fb1a74a89ae9878. cg.h/cgGL.h have closed pins. Toolkit and installed Cg/CgGL wholefiles differ; selected .text/.rodata hashes match. Future link inputs are only authenticated current-image libraries, never toolkit/Trace DSOs or Panda parser-inc stubs. No publisher signature or full header ABI identity is asserted.\n\nDesign: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-15-panda-sdk-cg-repair-design.md. Four-task TDD plan: docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-15-panda-sdk-cg-candidate-v1.md. Contract/evidence: docs/evidence/panda-sdk-cg-design-01/. The actual flag is --use-nvidiacg with explicit nvidiacg/cggl paths. Build uses a fresh ubuntu-24.04/GCC13 measured profile; it cannot reuse the old GCC14 profile or claim a Cg-only experiment. Local space is below the build bound; no old evidence is removed.\n\nNecessary static offsets: major0x688/minor0x68c/vendor0x670, checked against binary bytes and an unexecuted compiler descriptor. Full ABI/unknown wheel sizes remain unqualified. The plan defines closed source/CI/request/unique build/job/artifact/carrier acceptance and negative diagnostics. Future compile-only attempt limits:2workers/1200scompile/2400stotal/8GiBoutput/12GiBworkspace/16GiBinitialfree/32MiBlogs/256MiBcarrier. No native target execution, image replacement or runtime slot is granted/consumed now. Image and granular runtime work remain separate contracts.\n\nDocs/evidence-only branch against unchanged feature/panda-object-abi-audit-v1/4b68ddd. All7087basefiles/modes,299pins,10originals,main,Drafts102\u2013121,native8/image3/mapping01/dispatch01/onefailedrealGLX01 and260source identities preserved. No candidate compile/load/native run, workflow/request activation, oldslot replay, Cloudregistry publication or main/shared-base update/merge. Scientificallowance0/strict0of4FAIL/Stage7INCOMPLETE; old defaultoffM1proof unchanged.\n\nFinal exactHEAD push+PR CI4jobs/attempt1/artifacts0/body roundtrip/live preservation/clean-tree evidence is written postcommit to output/stage7-panda-sdk-cg-design-01/final-verification.json.\n",
